WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.459
In golf,

00:00:01.459 --> 00:00:02.794
when it comes to diversity,

00:00:02.794 --> 00:00:05.046
it has been honestly

00:00:05.046 --> 00:00:06.006
a tough road.

00:00:08.008 --> 00:00:09.676
I wanted to put down on paper

00:00:09.676 --> 00:00:12.971 position:58%
what I wanted to look like while I
was on out the golf course, you know,

00:00:12.971 --> 00:00:15.849
jeans, sweatshirt,
Cuban link chain

00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:18.143
and some sneakers
and even a fitted hat.

00:00:18.143 --> 00:00:21.146
&lt;font color=#FFE400FF&gt;And
we're literally&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font
color=#FFE400FF&gt;gravitating
people to the game&lt;/font&gt;

00:00:21.146 --> 00:00:22.439
&lt;font color=#FFE400FF&gt;just
through clothing.&lt;/font&gt;

00:00:27.861 --> 00:00:30.071
My name is Olajuwon Ajanaku

00:00:30.071 --> 00:00:31.906
founder of Eastside Golf

00:00:31.906 --> 00:00:33.908
and also a professional golfer.

00:00:33.908 --> 00:00:36.745
&lt;font color=#FFE400FF&gt;And I'm
Earl Cooper, co-founder&lt;/font&gt;

00:00:36.745 --> 00:00:38.913 position:64%
&lt;font color=#FFE400FF&gt;and also one of the
best &lt;/font&gt; &lt;font color=#FFE400FF&gt;young
teachers in America.&lt;/font&gt;

00:00:40.081 --> 00:00:44.878
A lot of other golf brands
you'll see golf /leisure wear,

00:00:44.878 --> 00:00:46.671
where ours is golf /streetwear.

00:00:47.881 --> 00:00:50.091
A lot of times people see our logo

00:00:50.091 --> 00:00:51.718
and we've been told
they see themselves.

00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:54.137
Taking the club back,
chain is swinging one way,

00:00:54.137 --> 00:00:56.431
you know, it
represents that I belong.

00:00:56.431 --> 00:00:59.559
It represents something I felt golf
has been missing for a long time.

00:01:00.477 --> 00:01:02.687
And now we're
growing into a brand

00:01:02.687 --> 00:01:04.397
that is truly changing golf.

00:01:06.107 --> 00:01:07.901
&lt;font color=#FFE400FF&gt;We have a
wide range of consumers&lt;/font&gt;

00:01:07.901 --> 00:01:12.901
&lt;font color=#FFE400FF&gt;that go
from an age range of &lt;/font&gt;
&lt;font color=#FFE400FF&gt;70-years-old
down to 17-years-old, &lt;/font&gt;

00:01:13.907 --> 00:01:15.283
&lt;font color=#FFE400FF&gt;men
and women.&lt;/font&gt;

00:01:15.283 --> 00:01:17.911 position:66%
&lt;font color=#FFE400FF&gt;And we
feel like that's&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font
color=#FFE400FF&gt;just representative&lt;/font&gt;

00:01:17.911 --> 00:01:20.830 position:59%
&lt;font color=#FFE400FF&gt;of what the game
really&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font color=#FFE400FF&gt;
should be and look like.&lt;/font&gt;

00:01:22.165 --> 00:01:25.752
And a lot of the pieces actually
live on and off the golf course.

00:01:25.752 --> 00:01:29.589
We have boutiques
that are interested in the polos,

00:01:29.589 --> 00:01:31.466
but then also, you know, pro shops.

00:01:31.466 --> 00:01:33.009
&lt;font color=#FFE400FF&gt;We're
rooted in golf.&lt;/font&gt;

00:01:33.009 --> 00:01:37.222 position:66%
&lt;font color=#FFE400FF&gt;We are a golf brand,
but we&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font color=#FFE400FF&gt; also
aren't lost in the fact that &lt;/font&gt;

00:01:37.222 --> 00:01:41.309
&lt;font color=#FFE400FF&gt;there is
so many other people &lt;/font&gt;
&lt;font color=#FFE400FF&gt;out here
that don't know the game.&lt;/font&gt;

00:01:41.309 --> 00:01:44.813 position:66%
&lt;font color=#FFE400FF&gt;It's designed from a
&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font color=#FFE400FF&gt;perspective
of it's a dual use.&lt;/font&gt;

00:01:44.813 --> 00:01:49.234
It truly is very important
to see representation in the game.

00:01:49.234 --> 00:01:52.403
When you look at golf itself,
they sell to golfers.

00:01:52.403 --> 00:01:53.530
When we're coming in,

00:01:53.530 --> 00:01:57.033
we have the partnerships
with NBA and MLB.

00:01:57.033 --> 00:01:59.786
I mean, we're talking to
these other organizations

00:01:59.786 --> 00:02:02.622
that truly want to see golf expand.

00:02:05.083 --> 00:02:07.961
I would say one of the
challenges that we've had,

00:02:07.961 --> 00:02:11.047
since we don't have
an apparel background,

00:02:11.047 --> 00:02:13.800
just as far as the
production process,

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:15.218
that's something
that we had to learn.

00:02:15.218 --> 00:02:17.095
&lt;font color=#FFE400FF&gt;Being
an entrepreneur,&lt;/font&gt;

00:02:17.095 --> 00:02:20.014 position:64%
&lt;font color=#FFE400FF&gt;I don't think
people&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font color=#FFE400FF&gt;truly
recognize the fact&lt;/font&gt;

00:02:20.014 --> 00:02:21.516
&lt;font color=#FFE400FF&gt;of
how difficult it is,&lt;/font&gt;

00:02:21.516 --> 00:02:23.393
&lt;font color=#FFE400FF&gt;especially
if you're &lt;/font&gt; &lt;font
color=#FFE400FF&gt;starting
in the space &lt;/font&gt;

00:02:23.393 --> 00:02:25.854
&lt;font color=#FFE400FF&gt;where it's
never been done before.&lt;/font&gt;

00:02:25.854 --> 00:02:29.816 position:66%
&lt;font color=#FFE400FF&gt;It's not just a
business&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font color=#FFE400FF&gt;that
