00:02:40.743 --> 00:02:44.289 position:61%
We're looking to scale the business and
double in staff by the end of the year.

00:02:44.289 --> 00:02:45.373
I feel like it's going to make

00:02:45.373 --> 00:02:47.667
the world of difference
and move our company forward.

00:02:48.877 --> 00:02:51.296
One of my favorite
moments, honestly,

00:02:51.296 --> 00:02:53.423
